            "text": "## What is Spam?\n\nSpam refers to unsolicited bulk messages, typically sent via email. Common types include advertising spam, phishing scams, and malware distribution.\n\n**Key Points:**\n- Spam costs businesses billions annually\n- Modern spam filters block 99%+ of spam\n- Never click links in suspicious emails",
